{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">藥明生物上半年多賺百分之4。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至24億元人民幣。經調整純利33億元人民幣，按年上升三成八。維持不派中期息。期內收入逾117億元人民幣，上升一成八。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T14:59:03.575093+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}